{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁאֵל","hw":"שְׁאֵל","html":"<big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵל</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. ask (</strong>v. BH<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:10\" href=\"/Daniel.2.10\">Dn 2:10</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵ֫לְנָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:9\" href=\"/Ezra.5.9\">Ezr 5:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:10\" href=\"/Ezra.5.10\">10</a>; Impf. 3 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁאֲלֶנְכוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:21\" href=\"/Ezra.7.21\">Ezr 7:21</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁאֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:11\" href=\"/Daniel.2.11\">Dn 2:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:27\" href=\"/Daniel.2.27\">27</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>ask for, request</em>, acc. rei <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:10\" href=\"/Daniel.2.10\">Dn 2:10</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> pers.), v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:11\" href=\"/Daniel.2.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:27\" href=\"/Daniel.2.27\">27</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:21\" href=\"/Ezra.7.21\">Ezr 7:21</a> (sf. pers.). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>inquire about, for</em>, acc. rei <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:9\" href=\"/Ezra.5.9\">Ezr 5:9</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> pers.); sq. orat. rect. v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:10\" href=\"/Ezra.5.10\">10</a> (id.).","next":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁאֵלָה","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שְׂעַר"}